{"seq":2,"slug":"renewable-coupling-system-integration","title":"波动性可再生能源耦合与电解制氢系统集成设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/green-hydrogen-electrolysis-fuel-cell-systems/electrolyzer-technology-engineering/renewable-coupling-system-integration","wordCount":3027,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"波动性可再生能源耦合与电解制氢系统集成设计\">波动性可再生能源耦合与电解制氢系统集成设计</h1><p>风光资源的小时级出力波动与电解槽的连续运行偏好之间存在结构性张力：一片 100 MW 光伏在晴朗正午的出力可能达到 85 MW，而阴天午后骤降到 20 MW，日落后直接归零。系统集成的任务不是&quot;消除&quot;这种波动，而是设计一套电气拓扑、容量配置和控制策略，让电解槽在不超出材料寿命约束的前提下，尽可能多地消纳这些低成本电力，同时把弃电和电网购电都压到最低。承接<a href=\"electrolysis-route-selection\">碱性/PEM/SOEC/AEM 电解技术路线原理对比与选型</a>给出的单机特性，本文讨论把它们组装成一座可投资、可调度的制氢厂时，工程上真正要做的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>耦合设计的三个独立变量是<strong>电气拓扑</strong>、<strong>容量比</strong>与<strong>调度策略</strong>。三者相互约束：拓扑决定了电能转换级数（进而决定效率损失），容量比决定了设备利用率与弃电量，调度策略则决定了电解槽承受多少启停与爬坡负荷。好的集成方案是在这三者之间找到总成本最低的工作点，而不是单点最优。</p>\n<p>电气拓扑的两种基本形态是<strong>交流耦合</strong>与<strong>直流耦合</strong>。交流耦合中，风光逆变器与电解整流器各自接入厂内交流母线，结构标准、设备易采购、便于接入电网，代价是多两级 AC/DC 与 DC/AC 转换。直流耦合让光伏组串经 DC/DC 变换器直接并入电解槽的直流母线，省去一次交直流往返，在纯离网场景下可提升系统效率 3–8 个百分点（IRENA《Green Hydrogen Cost Reduction》对直流耦合拓扑的效率评估）。下图给出典型并网型风光制氢厂的电气结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[光伏阵列] --&gt; B[PV 逆变器&lt;br/&gt;AC 800V]&#10;    C[风电机组] --&gt; D[风机变流器&lt;br/&gt;AC 690V]&#10;    B --&gt; E[厂内交流母线&lt;br/&gt;升压变压器]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{并网 / 离网}&#10;    F --&gt;|并网| G[电网&lt;br/&gt;购电与售电 MM]&#10;    F --&gt;|供电| H[整流变压器&lt;br/&gt;+ 整流器 AC/DC]&#10;    H --&gt; I[电解直流母线&lt;br/&gt;600-1500V DC]&#10;    I --&gt; J[电解槽堆&lt;br/&gt;ALK / PEM]&#10;    J --&gt; K[气液分离&lt;br/&gt;+ 氢气纯化]&#10;    K --&gt; L[压缩 / 储氢]\">graph TD\n    A[光伏阵列] --&gt; B[PV 逆变器&lt;br/&gt;AC 800V]\n    C[风电机组] --&gt; D[风机变流器&lt;br/&gt;AC 690V]\n    B --&gt; E[厂内交流母线&lt;br/&gt;升压变压器]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{并网 / 离网}\n    F --&gt;|并网| G[电网&lt;br/&gt;购电与售电 MM]\n    F --&gt;|供电| H[整流变压器&lt;br/&gt;+ 整流器 AC/DC]\n    H --&gt; I[电解直流母线&lt;br/&gt;600-1500V DC]\n    I --&gt; J[电解槽堆&lt;br/&gt;ALK / PEM]\n    J --&gt; K[气液分离&lt;br/&gt;+ 氢气纯化]\n    K --&gt; L[压缩 / 储氢]</pre><p>下表对比三种主流耦合模式在工程上的实际表现。数据区间综合 IRENA 与 IEA《Global Hydrogen Review》系列报告，并随项目边界条件浮动。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>拓扑要点</th>\n<th>系统效率</th>\n<th>电网依赖</th>\n<th>典型适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并网型交流耦合</td>\n<td>风光+电网共供交流母线</td>\n<td>基准（≈60–65% LHV）</td>\n<td>高，需 PPA 或电网电</td>\n<td>追求高利用率、有绿电 PPA 的工业项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离网型交流耦合</td>\n<td>独立微网，配储能/柴发调峰</td>\n<td>略低于并网</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>偏远矿区、孤岛、无法接入电网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离网型直流耦合</td>\n<td>PV 经 DC/DC 直挂电解直流母线</td>\n<td>高 3–8pp</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>纯光伏制氢、示范与小型项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>高利用率与低电价是一对矛盾：并网型可把电解槽年利用率从纯风光的 30–40% 拉到 60–80%，但购电部分往往推高加权电价；纯离网型电价极低（弃电边际成本近零），但设备折旧被摊薄在较少产氢量上。取舍最终落在平准化制氢成本（LCOH）上，其完整测算见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../hydrogen-system-policy-model/lcoh-cost-modeling-sensitivity\">LCOH 成本建模与敏感性分析</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"电力电子与整流变换\">电力电子与整流变换</h2><p>电解槽吃的是直流电，而风光、电网给的是交流（除直流耦合外），整流器因此是耦合链路上最关键的适配层。工业整流主流方案有两类：<strong>晶闸管（SCR）整流</strong>与 <strong>IGBT 高频整流</strong>。晶闸管整流结构简单、耐压耐流、单机功率可达数十兆瓦，缺点是功率因数随负载下降、谐波高、输出纹波大。IGBT 整流采用 PWM 调制，功率因数可保持在 0.99 以上、谐波小、动态响应快，正成为 PEM 与动态工况项目的首选，代价是成本更高、大功率器件散热要求高。</p>\n<p>电流纹波不是细节问题，而是寿命问题。电解槽允许的直流电流纹波通常要求低于额定电流的 1–5%（视厂家与路线而定，ISO 22734《Hydrogen generators using water electrolysis》对电气输入质量有相应规定），过大纹波会加速电极腐蚀、加剧气体互窜（HTO）并使产氢纯度下降。工程上通过多脉波整流、加平波电抗器或 IGBT 高频整流压制纹波。并网侧还需满足谐波限值，通常参照 IEEE 519 对电流畸变率（THD）的要求，通过无源/有源滤波或整流变压器移相绕组达标。</p>\n<p>变换级数直接决定效率损失。典型单级 AC/DC 整流效率在 96–98%，变压器再加约 1–2% 损耗。直流耦合省去逆变与整流的往返，但需宽输入 DC/DC 变换器应对光伏电压随辐照度与温度的大幅波动，其 MPPT 与电解槽恒流/恒压控制的耦合算法是核心技术门槛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风光出力曲线与容量配置\">风光出力曲线与容量配置</h2><p>容量配置回答一个具体问题：电解槽额定功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{el}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与风光装机容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{re}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应取多大比例。定义风光容量因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>8760</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CF_{re} = \\frac{E_{re}}{P_{re} \\times 8760}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8760</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以中纬度地区为例，光伏容量因子约 0.18–0.24，陆上风电约 0.30–0.45。若电解槽按风光平均出力配套，则大量时段会因电力不足而低负荷运行；若按峰值配套，则大部分时间设备闲置。工程上常用<strong>超配比</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = P_{re}/P_{el}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 来表达：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时电解槽峰值受限、必然弃电，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 优待电力充足但设备利用率低。纯光伏项目的经验区间是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\approx 1.3–2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3–2.0</span></span></span></span></span>，配合适度储能或电网兜底可显著改善全周期产氢量（IEA《Global Hydrogen Review 2024》对风光制氢利用小时数的情景分析）。</p>\n<p>衡量配置优劣的核心指标是<strong>年利用小时数</strong>（FLH）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>8760</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FLH = \\frac{E_{in,el}}{P_{el}} = CF_{re} \\times k \\times 8760 \\times \\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8760</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对纯离网光伏项目，FLH 常在 2500–3500 小时区间，对应电解槽容量因子仅 30–40%；并网型可做到 5000–7000 小时。差异直接反映在单位产氢的设备折旧成本上。配置优化的目标函数是把 LCOH 最小化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LCOH</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LCOH} = \\frac{\\sum_{t=0}^{n} \\dfrac{CAPEX_t + OPEX_t}{(1+r)^t}}{\\sum_{t=0}^{n} \\dfrac{M_{H_2,t}}{(1+r)^t}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LCOH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.8727em;vertical-align:-2.1863em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6863em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5903em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6863em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizin